  <div class="reviews-grid">
    <div class="rev-card reveal reveal-delay-1"><div class="rev-top"><div class="rev-av" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1400ff,#0040ff)">GF</div><div><div class="rev-name">GameFleet</div><div class="rev-handle">@gamefleet_yt • YouTube</div></div></div><div class="rev-stars">★★★★★</div><div class="rev-body">"Tiger Host changed everything. Mumbai nodes give our players under 5ms ping."</div><div class="rev-verified">✓ Verified Partner</div></div>
    <div class="rev-card reveal reveal-delay-2"><div class="rev-top"><div class="rev-av" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#cc2200,#ff4400)">BP</div><div><div class="rev-name">BatuPlays</div><div class="rev-handle">@batuplayslive • Twitch</div></div></div><div class="rev-stars">★★★★★</div><div class="rev-body">"Tried 5 different hosts — Tiger Host is in a different league. Zero lag at peak hours!"</div><div class="rev-verified">✓ Verified Partner</div></div>
    <div class="rev-card reveal reveal-delay-3"><div class="rev-top"><div class="rev-av" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0088ff,#00ccff)">MC</div><div><div class="rev-name">MCFrame</div><div class="rev-handle">@mcframe_official • YouTube</div></div></div><div class="rev-stars">★★★★★</div><div class="rev-body">"200-player Rust server hasn't dropped once in 6 months. DDoS protection is insane."</div><div class="rev-verified">✓ Verified Partner</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- FAQ -->
<div class="faq">
  <div class="faq-head reveal"><div class="sec-tag-inline">FAQ</div><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <div class="faq-item open reveal reveal-delay-1"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How quickly is my server available?<span class="faq-plus">+</span></div><div class="faq-a">Your server deploys automatically within 60 seconds of payment confirmation.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item reveal reveal-delay-2"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Can I upgrade my plan later?<span class="faq-plus">+</span></div><div class="faq-a">Yes, anytime from the client area. Upgrades are prorated — you only pay the difference.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item reveal reveal-delay-3"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">What are your cancellation/refund policies?<span class="faq-plus">+</span></div><div class="faq-a">We offer a full 24-hour money-back guarantee. Contact support within 24 hours.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item reveal reveal-delay-4"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Do you support Indian payment methods?<span class="faq-plus">+</span></div><div class="faq-a">Yes! We support UPI, Net Banking, Credit/Debit Cards, Wallets and cryptocurrency. All prices are in INR.</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
